OL,3,GNEWSAOpera singer leads Scottish
OL,4,Atakeover of the Last Night of the Proms
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen opera singer Nicky Spence took to
OL,7,Fthe famous stage of London's Royal
OL,8,FAlbert Hall for the Last Night Proms,
OL,9,Fjust a tartan scarf hinted at his
OL,10,Froots.
OL,12,FBut when he ripped off his "boring
OL,13,Fblack trousers" to reveal a pair of
OL,14,Ftartan trews during a rendition of
OL,15,FDonald, Where's Your Troosers? there
OL,16,Fwas no doubt of his heritage.
OL,18,FIt was part of Scotch Snap - a medley
OL,19,Fof traditional and modern classics -
OL,20,Fwhich the Dumfries native combined with
OL,21,Fdance moves and a series of patriotic
OL,22,Foutfits.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
